                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Like most people who use this platform, I own WAY too many games i've never played. to combat this, i added all my games to a wheel and gave them as long as a I could. Here is my take for this game:\nIts a point and click adventure which was taking a while to reach the point. I personally had a walkthrough open the whole time which is more like copy-pasting than playing a game. Not hating on people that like to play this way and i was interested in the art style. It wasn't overly my thing but can't say its a bad game. Play it if you like P&C stuff 5/10",
